Z||000000||Brad||09-24-2000||09:47 PM||||I have an 86GT and am want to replace the outer window seals.  Has anyone done this and know how to get at the screws which hold the seal strip without removing the window. <P>Thanks,<P>Brad.||||reg||1
Z||000001||StuGood||09-24-2000||10:58 PM||||Ummmm.... yes.  Someone knows how, and someone has done it before.<P>You're referring to the "dew wipes."  Do a search using "dew wipes," and you should find a few hints.<P>Also, try the MI Fiero Club web site for instructions. <A HREF="http://www.tir.com/~jaski/MI_Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.tir.com/~jaski/MI_Fiero.htm</A> <P>Scroll down to where it says "Fiero Tips," then click on the link that talks about replacing the dew wipes. <BR>  <p>[This message has been edited by StuGood (edited 09-24-2000).]||||reg||12
